{"file": "穿越六零之我在山洞闷声发家-第71集.mp4", "ep": 71, "duration": 60.0, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.8, "text": "这就是我的底气"}, {"start": 2.8, "end": 3.8, "text": "呦"}, {"start": 3.8, "end": 12.99, "text": "秦天"}, {"start": 12.99, "end": 13.99, "text": "这是晋山啊"}, {"start": 13.99, "end": 14.99, "text": "王婶"}, {"start": 14.99, "end": 15.99, "text": "李婶"}, {"start": 15.99, "end": 16.99, "text": "我晋山转转"}, {"start": 16.99, "end": 19.09, "text": "听说你进机械厂当工人了"}, {"start": 19.09, "end": 20.09, "text": "真的假的"}, {"start": 21.09, "end": 22.09, "text": "就是临时工"}, {"start": 22.09, "end": 23.09, "text": "采购员"}, {"start": 23.09, "end": 24.09, "text": "给厂里弄点山货"}, {"start": 24.09, "end": 26.09, "text": "临时工也是工人"}, {"start": 26.09, "end": 27.09, "text": "吃商品粮呢"}, {"start": 27.09, "end": 28.09, "text": "阿天"}, {"start": 28.09, "end": 29.09, "text": "你都十九了"}, {"start": 29.09, "end": 30.09, "text": "也该说媳妇了"}, {"start": 30.09, "end": 31.09, "text": "宅基地都批了"}, {"start": 31.09, "end": 33.09, "text": "盖房正好结婚用"}, {"start": 34.09, "end": 35.09, "text": "沈子们"}, {"start": 35.09, "end": 36.86, "text": "我刚立住脚"}, {"start": 36.86, "end": 37.86, "text": "不着急"}, {"start": 38.86, "end": 41.46, "text": "天哥"}, {"start": 41.46, "end": 43.52, "text": "你现在有相众的姑娘吗"}, {"start": 43.52, "end": 48.82, "text": "我想先把日子过安稳"}, {"start": 48.82, "end": 49.82, "text": "秦大哥"}, {"start": 49.82, "end": 56.54, "text": "你晋山带我一起呗"}, {"start": 56.54, "end": 57.54, "text": "我认识路"}, {"start": 57.54, "end": 58.54, "text": "不添麻烦"}]}